Subject: [PATCH 1197/3799] soh: rename func_80A7A568 -> EnIn_HorseRentalActive

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: runs while the rented horse's timer is counting; expiry hands off to EnIn_RentalTimeExpired's follow-up state, and talking charges 50 rupees for another race or ends the rental.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_In/z_en_in.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_In/z_en_in.c | 9 +++++----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_In/z_en_in.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_In/z_en_in.c
